/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 713 Tm (Eigenvectors reveal the natural axes of a transformation. Along these axes the) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 698 Tm (matrix acts like simple scaling, which makes repeated multiplication easy to) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 683 Tm (predict. After many steps, the direction with the largest eigenvalue usually) Tj
